---
import type { Locale } from '../data/types';
interface Props { locale: Locale; }
const {locale}=Astro.props;
const zh=locale==='zh';
---
<div class="banner-execution-visual banner-visual">
  <div class="execution-concept">
    <img src={`/images/hero/execution-loop-${locale}_V1.0.webp`} width="1774" height="887" loading="eager" decoding="async" alt={zh?'执行闭环：一句话交办后，数字员工理解目标、拆解规划，调用企业知识、业务系统和岗位技能跨系统执行，校验成果后交付经营图表与简报，送达协作群，再根据反馈持续跟进。':'A complete workflow: one request, understanding and planning, execution using company knowledge, business systems and role skills, result review, charts and briefs delivered to the team, followed by feedback and follow-through.'}/>
    <span class="execution-flow-light" aria-hidden="true"></span>
  </div>

</div>
